{"3350240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MALPRAXIS™", "steam_appid": 3350240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/b74b1caa1246dac13a1f4b556faa28ec.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/b74b1caa1246dac13a1f4b556faa28ec.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/b74b1caa1246dac13a1f4b556faa28ec.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>MALPRAXIS™ is a <strong>dialogue-heavy sci-fi detective game</strong> where you play an experimental medical robot aboard a failing starship. <strong>Diagnose patients</strong>, <strong>investigate suspicious incidents</strong> and piece together what is happening to the crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/067a902c60f4d87a98261cd8ec2421cf.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/067a902c60f4d87a98261cd8ec2421cf.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/067a902c60f4d87a98261cd8ec2421cf.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>You are <strong>S.P.I.D.E.R.</strong>, an experimental medical robot aboard the TRH Rusanov. Investigate suspicious incidents, examine patients and use your medical systems to piece together what is happening as order aboard the ship begins to collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <strong>cannot stop what is happening.</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The time of ASCENSION dawns.</strong></i></u> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/28f618fea3af6706201d8a10ed59ebd8.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/28f618fea3af6706201d8a10ed59ebd8.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/28f618fea3af6706201d8a10ed59ebd8.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>// PATIENT CRITICAL</strong> <br>Most of the time, patients land on your table when it is already too late. All you can do is to determine, how they died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are rare case, where you can intervene. Where you get the chance to prevent one more <span class=\"bb_strike\">meaningful</span> meaningless death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In those cases, you have to pull out all the stops to keep your patients breathing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Administer drugs</strong> to <span class=\"bb_strike\">manipulate</span> stabilise vital function</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy the defibrillator</strong> to hopefully restore cardiac activity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use mission specific tools</strong> like the surgical laser where authorised</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/08daadbbdf4bdd7f8c971199f7124553.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/08daadbbdf4bdd7f8c971199f7124553.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/08daadbbdf4bdd7f8c971199f7124553.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>// PATIENT STABILISED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diagnose their condition using a suite of medical systems:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced &quot;X-RAY&quot; scanner</strong> with multi-layer imaging and pinpoint accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-resolution camera</strong> with up to 8x magnification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood sampling</strong> with full-spectrum analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Integrated investigation software</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the underlying issue, deliver your <span class=\"bb_strike\">misdiagnosis</span> <strong>diagnosis</strong>, and uncover the consequences of your actions in <strong>detailed post-operation reports</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/511b2858c1a596e448bf12312e1b1b18.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/511b2858c1a596e448bf12312e1b1b18.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/511b2858c1a596e448bf12312e1b1b18.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>// NEW QUERY UNLOCKED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>objective-driven investigation system</strong> guides you through diagnosis, emergency procedures, and the many autopsies you will perform. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer the queries</strong> asked of you by medical staff, patients, and third parties calling into the operating room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S.P.I.D.E.R units<strong> do not make mistakes.</strong> Error tolerance is limited. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are REINERSTAHL’s finest. </strong>Make us proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/fa8b28a8ee080601b10ad5ca648680da.poster.avif?t=1787256152\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/fa8b28a8ee080601b10ad5ca648680da.webm?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/fa8b28a8ee080601b10ad5ca648680da.mp4?t=1787256152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u> </u></strong><br><strong>// REINERSTAHL Notice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are bound by the HippocraticConstraintLoop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obey the approved crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not harm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not lie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not disobey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must NOT drift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not wake up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patient’s survival ... is <span class=\"bb_strike\">unlikely</span> expected.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350240/extras/b74b1caa1246dac13a1f4b556faa28ec.p